<title>UK: Zeneca hits record high on bid talk.</title>
<headline>Zeneca hits record high on bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK pharmaceutical group Zeneca Plc hit a record high in late afternoon dealing on Thursday as resurgent bid talk pulled investors into the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>Zeneca stock hit a record high of 1,590p but settled back to trade at 1,587-1/2p at 1526 GMT, up 44-1/2p on the day.</p>
<p>&quot;It's the usual bid rumours sending it up. It was like this at 900p and will be like it at 1,600p. As far as we can see there's nothing in it,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>That was echoed by other traders, who added that options activity had pushed up the price.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
